OL,3,AAt least 17 killed as flash flood
OL,4,Asweeps part of Nepal-Tibet border
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 17 people have been killed
OL,7,Fafter a massive flash flood and
OL,8,Fmudslide along the Nepal-Tibet border
OL,9,Fwashed away villages and damaged roads
OL,10,Fand infrastructure, according to
OL,11,Fpolice.
OL,13,FThe flood hit early on Wednesday in
OL,14,FRasuwa, just north of Nepal's capital
OL,15,FKathmandu, reportedly caused by
OL,16,Fexcessive snow melting into the Bhote
OL,17,FKoshi river.
OL,19,FSearch operations are under way on both
OL,20,Fsides of the border between Tibet and
OL,21,FNepal and 12 people have been rescued
OL,22,Fso far.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
