OL,3,AAt least 17 killed as flash flood
OL,4,Asweeps part of Nepal-Tibet border
OL,5,
OL,6,FState media in China, which controls
OL,7,FTibet, say there are significant
OL,8,Fcasualties and Nepalese officials said
OL,9,Fthey anticipate "huge scale loss".
